# Project specific
# *.dxf is ignored because DXF here is normally generated output. The vendored
# body outlines are the exception: they are source INPUT to the exporter, and
# without them the DXF suite cannot run anywhere but the machine that has a
# luthiers-toolbox checkout. See fixtures/geometry/sources/README.md.
*.dxf
!/fixtures/geometry/sources/*.dxf
*.nc
*.gcode
*.tap
/output/

# Exports (allow proposal markdown fixtures and workbooks)
/exports/*
!/exports/proposals/
!/exports/workbooks/
